DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssddhhcc driver provides support for SD controllers following the SD Host
     Controller Standard Simplified Specification.

     The sdmmc(4) subsystem performs SD/MMC transactions to communicate with
     whatever MMC, SD, SDHC, or SDIO devices are inserted into the SD slot.

